msgid "quarkus:build"
msgstr ""

msgid "Builds the Quarkus application."
msgstr ""

msgid "[[quarkus-maven-plugin-goal-build-parameter-table]] Parameter"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"[[quarkus-maven-plugin-goal-build-appArtifact]] appArtifact\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Coordinates of the Maven artifact containing the original Java application to build the native image for. If not provided, the current project is assumed to be the original Java application.\n"
"The coordinates are expected to be expressed in the following format:\n"
"\n"
"groupId:artifactId:classifier:type:version\n"
"\n"
"With the classifier, type and version being optional.\n"
"\n"
"If the type is missing, the artifact is assumed to be of type JAR.\n"
"\n"
"If the version is missing, the artifact is going to be looked up among the project dependencies using the provided coordinates.\n"
"\n"
"However, if the expression consists of only three parts, it is assumed to be groupId:artifactId:version.\n"
"\n"
"If the expression consists of only four parts, it is assumed to be groupId:artifactId:classifier:type.\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

msgid "[[quarkus-maven-plugin-goal-build-appArtifact]] appArtifact"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Coordinates of the Maven artifact containing the original Java application to build the native image for. If not provided, the current project is assumed to be the original Java application.\n"
"The coordinates are expected to be expressed in the following format:"
msgstr ""

msgid "groupId:artifactId:classifier:type:version"
msgstr ""

msgid "With the classifier, type and version being optional."
msgstr ""

msgid "If the type is missing, the artifact is assumed to be of type JAR."
msgstr ""

msgid "If the version is missing, the artifact is going to be looked up among the project dependencies using the provided coordinates."
msgstr ""

msgid "However, if the expression consists of only three parts, it is assumed to be groupId:artifactId:version."
msgstr ""

msgid "If the expression consists of only four parts, it is assumed to be groupId:artifactId:classifier:type."
msgstr ""

