"When enabled, the <environmentVariables> and <systemPropertyVariables> elements of the Maven Surefire plugin are copied to environment variables and system properties defined by this plugin. Note that no other Surefire configuration is used (notably <systemProperties>), only the 2 elements mentioned above.\n"
"This plugin's <environmentVariables> and <systemProperties> have priority, so duplicate keys are not copied.\n"
